b794b3fa06ab))(text "470pF is at the RHD pin; 10M bleeds the internal node. Switch capacitance/leakage/injection and shared reference mismatch remain modeled assumptions." (at 20.32 371.475 0) (effects (font (size 1 1)) (justify left)) (uuid 6785dee1-ca9f-5613-9826-16a080e046da))(text "Fault threshold follows +/-5V rails and is far outside RHD +/-0.4V linear DC range. External low-voltage qualification is mandatory before unclamping." (at 20.32 379.095 0) (effects (font (size 1 1)) (justify left)) (uuid 0706a283-c225-51e1-afeb-ba26a8c7e50d)))
